#: script/events/global.js:15
msgid "say he should be strung up as an example."
msgstr "dicen que debería ser colgado para que sirva como ejemplo."

#: script/events/global.js:14
msgid "say his folk have been skimming the supplies."
msgstr "dicen que su grupo ha estado robando las provisiones."

#: script/events/room.js:1146
msgid "say nobody knows"
msgstr "decir que nadie lo sabe"

#: script/events/room.js:1348
#: script/events/room.js:1389
#: script/events/room.js:933
#: script/events/room.js:949
#: script/room.js:2130
msgid "say nothing"
msgstr "no decir nada"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1891
msgid "say that you are short"
msgstr "decir que te falta"

#: script/swamp.js:91
msgid "says a small number of people stood up when the sentence was read, and that standing up did not help, and that the same sentence was read over them."
msgstr "dice que un pequeño número de personas se puso de pie cuando se leyó la sentencia, y que ponerse de pie no ayudó, y que se les leyó la misma sentencia."

#: script/events/room.js:927
msgid "says actions out here have consequences, and that the consequences do not arrive as punishment. they arrive as doors that are already shut when you get to them."
msgstr "dice que las acciones aquí afuera tienen consecuencias, y que las consecuencias no llegan como castigo. llegan como puertas que ya están cerradas cuando llegas a ellas."

#: script/events/room.js:942
msgid "says consequences are not a threat he is making. they are a thing that has already started, and you will feel it as luck turning against you, and you will call it luck."
msgstr "dice que las consecuencias no son una amenaza que esté haciendo. son algo que ya ha comenzado, y lo sentirás como la suerte volviéndose en tu contra, y lo llamarás suerte."

#: script/events/room.js:1189
msgid "says every settlement gives her a different name, and the older the settlement, the less certain they are."
msgstr "dice que cada asentamiento le da un nombre distinto, y mientras más antiguo el asentamiento, más incierto están."

#: script/events/room.js:911
msgid "says everything you do out here is done in front of somebody, and that they carry it further than you do."
msgstr "dice que todo lo que haces aquí afuera se hace frente a alguien, y que ellos lo llevan más lejos que tú."

#: script/events/room.js:457
msgid "says he can build you a hut for less wood"
msgstr "dice que puede construirte una cabaña con menos madera"

#: script/events/room.js:926
msgid "says he has been to three settlements this season and your name came up at two of them, and not well."
msgstr "dice que ha estado en tres asentamientos esta temporada y tu nombre salió en dos de ellos, y no bien."

#: script/swamp.js:113
msgid "says he has gone perhaps a dozen times, and each one took a little off the top, and he can still tell you the name of the ship he was born on."
msgstr "dice que ha ido quizás una docena de veces, y cada una se llevó un poco de él, y aún puede decirte el nombre de la nave en la que nació."

#: script/events/room.js:943
msgid "says he has seen someone do all of this before, at a scale you would not believe, and that they are still paying for it."
msgstr "dice que ha visto a alguien hacer todo esto antes, a una escala que no creerías, y que todavía lo está pagando."

#: script/events/path.js:537
msgid "says he is going to walk until he reaches the edge of it. says he has worked out that there has to be one."
msgstr "dice que va a caminar hasta llegar al borde de eso. dice que ha calculado que tiene que haber uno."

#: script/space.js:692
msgid "says he is prepared to follow you again, if you will have him. says the last time did not go especially well and that he has had four hundred centuries to think about what he would do differently."
msgstr "dice que está dispuesto a seguirte de nuevo, si lo aceptas. dice que la última vez no salió especialmente bien y que ha tenido cuarenta mil años para pensar qué haría distinto."

#: script/events/room.js:941
msgid "says he knows what you have been doing. says everyone between here and the flats knows what you have been doing."
msgstr "dice que sabe lo que has estado haciendo. dice que todos entre aquí y las llanuras saben lo que has estado haciendo."

#: script/swamp.js:73
msgid "says he served under a commander he would have followed anywhere and largely did."
msgstr "dice que sirvió bajo un comandante al que habría seguido a cualquier parte y en gran medida lo hizo."

#: script/swamp.js:92
msgid "says he was one. says there was one other, and she is not here, and he does not say more than that."
msgstr "dice que él era uno. dice que había otro más, y ella no está aquí, y no dice más que eso."

#: script/swamp.js:136
msgid "says he will be here. says that is not a promise, it is just the only fact he has left."
msgstr "dice que estará aquí. dice que eso no es una promesa, es solo el único hecho que le queda."

#: script/room.js:2110
msgid "says in that case the huts should be built to last, and that she knows how, given steel."
msgstr "dice que en ese caso las cabañas deberían construirse para durar, y que sabe cómo, con acero."

#: script/events/executioner.js:2452
msgid "says it can't die."
msgstr "dice que no puede morir."

#: script/events/outside.js:161
msgid "says it is not the first thing she has had to rebuild. says that is not much comfort and offers it anyway."
msgstr "dice que esto no es lo primero que ha tenido que reconstruir. dice que eso no es mucho consuelo y lo ofrece de todas formas."

#: script/room.js:2111
msgid "says people work better when they are not waiting for the roof to come down."
msgstr "dice que la gente trabaja mejor cuando no está esperando que el techo se venga abajo."

#: script/events/road.js:666
msgid "says she has stopped believing the answers and started keeping a list of who gave them."
msgstr "dice que ha dejado de creer las respuestas y ha empezado a llevar una lista de quién las dio."

#: script/room.js:2095
msgid "says she has watched people follow you before. says she has watched what it cost them."
msgstr "dice que ha visto a gente seguirte antes. dice que ha visto lo que les costó."

#: script/events/road.js:665
msgid "says she is going to go back and ask better questions."
msgstr "dice que va a volver y hacer mejores preguntas."

#: script/events/road.js:664
msgid "says she is going to try north next, when she can walk properly."
msgstr "dice que va a intentar hacia el norte a continuación, cuando pueda caminar bien."

#: script/events/room.js:1135
msgid "says she is making a register of settlements. asks what this one is called."
msgstr "dice que está haciendo un registro de asentamientos. pregunta cómo se llama este."

#: script/room.js:2056
msgid "says she is not asking to be difficult. says the answer changes what she builds next."
msgstr "dice que no pregunta por ser difícil. dice que la respuesta cambia lo que construye después."

#: script/events/road.js:662
msgid "says she walked east because the last three people she asked all said something different, and east was the only direction nobody had ruled out."
msgstr "dice que caminó hacia el este porque las últimas tres personas a las que preguntó dijeron algo distinto, y el este era la única dirección que nadie había descartado."

#: script/events/room.js:1778
msgid "says thank you once, plainly, and then talks about something else for the rest of the evening."
msgstr "dice gracias una vez, sencillamente, y luego habla de otra cosa por el resto de la tarde."

#: script/events/room.js:883
msgid "says that is worth more than any of the three things he taught you, and that it took longer to earn."
msgstr "dice que eso vale más que cualquiera de las tres cosas que te enseñó, y que tomó más tiempo ganárselo."

#: script/events/room.js:882
msgid "says that people out here talk, and that what they say about this village has started arriving before you do."
msgstr "dice que la gente aquí afuera habla, y que lo que dicen de este poblado ha empezado a llegar antes que tú."

#: script/events/road.js:669
msgid "says that sometimes all you can do is commit to a direction to avoid madness."
msgstr "dice que a veces lo único que se puede hacer es comprometerse con una dirección para evitar la locura."

#: script/swamp.js:74
msgid "says the commander was not cruel. says that is what made the rest of it possible -- nobody follows a monster in those numbers."
msgstr "dice que el comandante no era cruel. dice que eso fue lo que hizo posible el resto -- nadie sigue a un monstruo en esas cantidades."

#: script/events/road.js:668
msgid "says the compass in your hand shows more than hers."
msgstr "dice que la brújula en tu mano muestra más que la de ella."

#: script/swamp.js:130
msgid "says the cycle is not a punishment anybody is still administering. says whoever passed the sentence is four hundred centuries dead and the machine is simply still running."
msgstr "dice que el ciclo no es un castigo que alguien siga administrando. dice que quien dictó la sentencia lleva cuarenta mil años muerto y la máquina simplemente sigue funcionando."

#: script/swamp.js:86
msgid "says the fleet is gone. not scattered -- gone. says there is no wanderer society left to go back to, and that most of what is buried on this rock is the last of it."
msgstr "dice que la flota ha desaparecido. no dispersa -- desaparecida. dice que no queda sociedad errante a la cual volver, y que la mayor parte de lo que está enterrado en esta roca es lo último que queda de ella."

#: script/events/room.js:1190
msgid "says the oldest ones do not give a name at all. they just point at the ground."
msgstr "dice que los más viejos no dan ningún nombre en absoluto. simplemente señalan el suelo."

#: script/space.js:691
msgid "says the terms were never as fixed as he let you believe. says he stayed because he had nowhere he would rather be broken, and that this, apparently, is not that any more."
msgstr "dice que los términos nunca fueron tan fijos como te dejó creer. dice que se quedó porque no había ningún otro lugar donde prefiriera estar roto, y que esto, al parecer, ya no es eso."

#: script/room.js:2096
msgid "says the traps will still fill. says she can salt what comes out of them, and that two people do not need a village to feed them."
msgstr "dice que las trampas seguirán llenándose. dice que puede salar lo que sale de ellas, y que dos personas no necesitan un poblado que los alimente."

#: script/events/room.js:897
msgid "says the trick is what you are still willing to do by the time you have."
msgstr "dice que el truco es lo que aún estás dispuesto a hacer para cuando lo hayas hecho."

#: script/events/room.js:913
msgid "says the wild is not the thing that decides how this goes."
msgstr "dice que la naturaleza no es lo que decide cómo termina esto."

#: script/swamp.js:67
msgid "says the worlds were not empty. says that is the part people leave out when they tell it."
msgstr "dice que los mundos no estaban vacíos. dice que esa es la parte que la gente omite cuando lo cuenta."

#: script/swamp.js:79
msgid "says there was another after that. one who thought the fleets were being wasted on conquest that stopped."
msgstr "dice que hubo otro después de eso. uno que pensaba que las flotas se desperdiciaban en una conquista que se detuvo."

#: script/swamp.js:80
msgid "says they locked that one up, and they were right to, and everyone agreed, and it held for a long time."
msgstr "dice que encerraron a ese, y que hicieron bien, y que todos estuvieron de acuerdo, y que aguantó mucho tiempo."

#: script/events/outside.js:839
msgid "says this world is the only one that never got a name, and that is why they are all still on it."
msgstr "dice que este mundo es el único que nunca recibió un nombre, y por eso todos siguen en él."

#: script/events/path.js:572
msgid "says two of them went anyway."
msgstr "dice que dos de ellos fueron de todas formas."

#: script/events/room.js:898
msgid "says you are doing better at that than most, and that most is not a high bar, and that he means it kindly."
msgstr "dice que te va mejor en eso que a la mayoría, y que la mayoría no es un estándar alto, y que lo dice con buena intención."

#: script/events/road.js:667
msgid "says you cant always trust your memory of where you have been before. take notes."
msgstr "dice que no siempre puedes confiar en tu memoria de dónde has estado antes. toma notas."

#: script/events/room.js:912
msgid "says you have a reputation. says it is not a bad one yet, and that yet is doing a great deal of work in that sentence."
msgstr "dice que tienes una reputación. dice que todavía no es mala, y que ese «todavía» está haciendo mucho trabajo en esa frase."

#: script/swamp.js:114
msgid "says you have gone so many times the furnace downstairs keeps a book on it."
msgstr "dice que has ido tantas veces que el horno de abajo lleva un registro."

#: script/events/room.js:928
msgid "says you still have time to change what people say. says it will take longer than earning it did."
msgstr "dice que todavía tienes tiempo de cambiar lo que dice la gente. dice que tomará más tiempo del que tomó ganárselo."

#: script/swamp.js:119
msgid "says you were a good one, doing a thing that should not have been done, extremely well."
msgstr "dice que fuiste bueno, haciendo algo que no debería haberse hecho, extremadamente bien."

#: script/localization.js:45
#: script/localization.js:50
msgid "scales"
msgstr "escama"

#: script/outside.js:117
msgid "scattered teeth"
msgstr "dientes dispersos"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1500
msgid "scavenge maps"
msgstr "rebuscar mapas"

#: script/events/encounters.js:239
msgid "scavenger"
msgstr "carroñero"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4788
msgid "scavenger had a small camp in the school."
msgstr "el carroñero tenía un pequeño campamento en la escuela."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4831
msgid "scavenger'd been looking for supplies in here, it seems."
msgstr "el carroñero estaba buscando suministros aquí, parece."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6283
msgid "scavengers must have gotten to this place already."
msgstr "los carroñeros ya deben haber llegado a este lugar."

#: script/outside.js:1548
msgid "scavening wanderers pick over the bodies on an old battlefield. a wanderer finds a dead human in shining armor. they are disappointed they can't use the armor because it only has two arms."
msgstr "errantes carroñeros hurgan entre los cuerpos en un antiguo campo de batalla. un errante encuentra a un humano muerto con una armadura reluciente. queda decepcionado al no poder usar la armadura porque solo tiene dos brazos."

#: script/outside.js:1159
msgid "scoff at her weakness"
msgstr "burlarse de su debilidad"

#: script/space.js:866
msgid "score for this game: {0}"
msgstr "puntuación de este juego: {0}"

#: script/engine.js:57
#: script/events/encounters.js:565
msgid "scout"
msgstr "explorar"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4702
msgid "scrap plating"
msgstr "blindaje de chatarra"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2149
msgid "scrape the rim"
msgstr "raspar el borde"

#: script/events/executioner.js:403
msgid "scraps of copper wire litter the floor."
msgstr "trozos de alambre de cobre cubren el suelo."

#: script/outside.js:102
msgid "scraps of fur"
msgstr "trozos de pelaje"

#: script/outside.js:135
msgid "scraps of iron"
msgstr "restos de hierro"

#: script/events/road.js:319
msgid "scratched into the underside of the rock, where somebody lying exactly here would see it, there is a line of marks."
msgstr "grabada en la parte inferior de la roca, donde alguien tumbado exactamente aquí la vería, hay una línea de marcas."

#: script/events/road.js:541
msgid "scratched on the underside of the middle stone there is a list of marks in different hands."
msgstr "grabada en la parte inferior de la piedra central hay una lista de marcas de diferentes manos."

#: script/prison.js:221
msgid "scratches on a sloped face, made by someone lying down."
msgstr "rasguños en una cara inclinada, hechos por alguien tumbado."

#: script/events/room.js:223
msgid "scratching noises can be heard from the store room."
msgstr "se escuchan chirridos desde el almacén."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:634
msgid "scribe"
msgstr "escriba"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1288
msgid "sealed"
msgstr "sellado"

#: script/fabricator.js:92
msgid "sealed at every seam. the counter on the chest goes quiet."
msgstr "sellado en cada costura. el contador en el pecho enmudece."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1249
msgid "sealing"
msgstr "sellando"

#: script/events/road.js:1627
msgid "search it"
msgstr "registrarlo"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2945
msgid "search the records"
msgstr "buscar en los registros"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6395
msgid "searching the bodies yields a few supplies."
msgstr "la búsqueda en los cuerpos produce algunos suministros."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1010
msgid "seated one"
msgstr "el sentado"

#: script/events/executioner.js:2160
msgid "security drones still patrol the hallways."
msgstr "drones de seguridad aún patrullan los pasillos."

#: script/events/executioner.js:2060
msgid "security is even tighter here."
msgstr "la seguridad es aún más estricta aquí."

#: script/engine.js:58
msgid "see farther"
msgstr "ver más lejos"

#: script/events/outside.js:591
msgid "see to our own dead first"
msgstr "atender primero a nuestros propios muertos"

#: script/outside.js:1429
msgid "seeing it in their eyes. some fear or resent you. but why?"
msgstr "viéndolo en sus ojos. algunos te temen o te resienten. ¿pero por qué?"

#: script/events/executioner.js:99
msgid "self-repair"
msgstr "autorreparación"

#: script/events/room.js:1155
msgid "send her on"
msgstr "dejarla seguir"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:239
msgid "sentinel"
msgstr "centinela"

#: script/events/outside.js:251
msgid "separate the sick"
msgstr "separar a los enfermos"

#: script/events/executioner.js:59
msgid "servos spin up"
msgstr "los servos aceleran"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3485
msgid "set the three in the floor"
msgstr "colocar los tres en el suelo"

#: script/events/executioner.js:357
#: script/events/setpieces.js:7200
msgid "sets himself"
msgstr "se prepara"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5881
msgid "sets itself"
msgstr "se prepara"

#: script/mobileUI.js:296
msgid "settings"
msgstr "ajustes"

#: script/events/encounters.js:165
msgid "shadow"
msgstr "sombra"

#: script/events/encounters.js:157
msgid "Shadow"
msgstr "Sombra"

#: script/events/room.js:1064
msgid "shamefully gather goods"
msgstr "recolectar bienes con vergüenza"

#: script/engine.js:854
msgid "Share"
msgstr "Compartir"

#: script/events/room.js:59
msgid "share a meal"
msgstr "compartir una comida"

#: script/engine.js:231
msgid "share."
msgstr "compartir."

#: script/events/global.js:76
msgid "shares what he knows about sneaking before he goes."
msgstr "comparte lo que sabe de sigilo antes de irse."

#: script/room.js:987
msgid "sharp teeth, hungry mouths and violent hearts desire blood. builder can make even stronger steel armour for protection."
msgstr "dientes afilados, bocas hambrientas y corazones violentos desean sangre. la constructora puede hacer una armadura de acero aún más resistente para protección."

#: script/room.js:952
msgid "sharp teeth, hungry mouths and violent hearts desire blood. builder can make stronger iron armour for protection. she likes to see you protected."
msgstr "dientes afilados, bocas hambrientas y corazones violentos desean sangre. la constructora puede hacer una armadura de hierro más resistente para protección. le gusta verte protegido."

#: script/room.js:917
msgid "sharp teeth, hungry mouths and violent hearts desire blood. builder can stitch together leather armour for protection. she worries about you."
msgstr "dientes afilados, bocas hambrientas y corazones violentos desean sangre. la constructora puede coser una armadura de cuero para protección. se preocupa por ti."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2331
msgid "she asked you not to, and you agreed, and that is the end of it for now."
msgstr "te pidió que no lo hicieras, y aceptaste, y eso es todo por ahora."

#: script/builder.js:189
msgid "she asks how thick the layers were. when you tell her, she goes quiet in the specific way she goes quiet when a number means something to her that it does not mean to you."
msgstr "pregunta qué tan gruesas eran las capas. cuando le dices, se queda callada de esa forma específica en que se queda callada cuando un número significa para ella algo que no significa para ti."

#: script/builder.js:193
msgid "she asks how you got in. you tell her about the six handprints and she stops what she is doing entirely. says that is not a lock, that is a quorum, and that nobody was ever meant to open that door on their own -- and then does not ask the obvious next question, and you both let her not ask it."
msgstr "pregunta cómo entraste. le cuentas sobre las seis huellas de manos y deja por completo lo que está haciendo. dice que eso no es una cerradura, es un quórum, y que nadie estaba destinado a abrir esa puerta por su cuenta -- y luego no hace la siguiente pregunta obvia, y ambos dejan que no la haga."

#: script/builder.js:185
msgid "she asks if the stars looked right. when you tell her they did not, she nods like that confirms something she already suspected and declines to say what."
msgstr "pregunta si las estrellas se veían bien. cuando le dices que no, asiente como confirmando algo que ya sospechaba y se niega a decir qué."

#: script/builder.js:169
msgid "she asks what they were like. not what they said -- what they were LIKE. says she has never been sure whether watching is a kindness or the absence of one, and that she has had a long time to decide and has not."
msgstr "pregunta cómo eran. no qué dijeron -- cómo ERAN. dice que nunca ha estado segura de si observar es una bondad o la ausencia de una, y que ha tenido mucho tiempo para decidirlo y no lo ha hecho."

#: script/events/road.js:1569
msgid "she asks whether it is over. told that nobody knows what \"it\" is, she says that is the correct answer and seems satisfied by it."
msgstr "pregunta si ya terminó. al decirle que nadie sabe qué es «eso», dice que esa es la respuesta correcta y parece satisfecha con ella."

#: script/builder.js:197
msgid "she asks you to say the charter again, slowly, and mouths the last line along with you the second time. says she did not know anyone had written that down. says somebody should have."
msgstr "te pide que repitas la carta de nuevo, despacio, y mueve los labios con la última línea la segunda vez. dice que no sabía que alguien había escrito eso. dice que alguien debería haberlo hecho."

#: script/builder.js:142
msgid "she banks it without being asked, out of habit, before she has even said anything about it. says a fire is the first thing and the last thing, whichever world you are having this argument on."
msgstr "lo aviva sin que se lo pidan, por costumbre, antes de haber dicho nada al respecto. dice que un fuego es lo primero y lo último, sea cual sea el mundo en el que se tenga esta discusión."

#: script/outside.js:1066
msgid "she bolts upright and awake."
msgstr "se incorpora de golpe, despierta."

#: script/builder.js:221
msgid "she builds what is asked for and does not argue about it. says only that she has seen a place run this way before, and that she was not one of the people running it."
msgstr "construye lo que se le pide y no lo discute. solo dice que ha visto un lugar funcionar así antes, y que ella no era una de las personas que lo dirigían."

#: script/builder.js:181
msgid "she checks you over before she says a word, the way she would check a wound. says glass like that does not happen on its own, and that whatever did it to the ground would have done the same to a person standing on it."
msgstr "te revisa antes de decir una palabra, de la forma en que revisaría una herida. dice que un vidrio así no ocurre solo, y que lo que sea que le hizo eso al suelo le habría hecho lo mismo a una persona parada sobre él."

#: script/events/road.js:1565
msgid "she comes back slowly, the way somebody surfaces rather than wakes."
msgstr "vuelve despacio, de la forma en que alguien emerge a la superficie más que despierta."

#: script/builder.js:228
msgid "she counts them twice, which does not change the number. says she does not know any of their names, and that this is the part she cannot get used to."
msgstr "los cuenta dos veces, lo cual no cambia el número. dice que no conoce ninguno de sus nombres, y que esa es la parte a la que no logra acostumbrarse."

#: script/events/room.js:1273
msgid "she does not argue. she writes something in the book, closes it, and walks."
msgstr "no discute. escribe algo en el libro, lo cierra, y camina."

#: script/room.js:2124
msgid "she does not argue. that is the part worth noticing."
msgstr "no discute. esa es la parte que vale la pena notar."

#: script/builder.js:165
msgid "she does not ask if you are alright. she can see that you are not, entirely. says a ship like that does not get built for one purpose, and asks, quietly, which purpose found you."
msgstr "no pregunta si estás bien. puede ver que no lo estás, del todo. dice que una nave así no se construye para un solo propósito, y pregunta, en voz baja, qué propósito te encontró a ti."

#: script/builder.js:118
msgid "she does not ask what happened out there. she can see most of it. says the wastes kill people on their own without any help from us, and that maybe there is another way, and that she knows how that sounds."
msgstr "no pregunta qué pasó allá afuera. puede ver la mayor parte. dice que los páramos matan gente por su cuenta sin ninguna ayuda de nosotros, y que quizás hay otra manera, y que sabe cómo suena eso."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2362
msgid "she does not explain how she found you. she asks you not to open the door."
msgstr "no explica cómo te encontró. te pide que no abras la puerta."

#: script/room.js:2123
msgid "she does not nod. she looks at the hut, and then at you, and then goes back to work."
msgstr "no asiente. mira la cabaña, y luego a ti, y luego vuelve al trabajo."

#: script/builder.js:177
msgid "she does not say i told you so, and you can see what it costs her not to. says she is glad you are standing in front of her and asks nothing else, and you understand that not asking is the kindness."
msgstr "no dice que te lo advirtió, y puedes ver lo que le cuesta no decirlo. dice que se alegra de que estés frente a ella y no pregunta nada más, y comprendes que no preguntar es la bondad."

#: script/events/encounters.js:1704
msgid "she does not say it unkindly. she goes back to the racks."
msgstr "no lo dice con crueldad. vuelve a los estantes."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2383
msgid "she does not say thank you. she does not say anything at all for the first hour of the walk."
msgstr "no dice gracias. no dice nada en absoluto durante la primera hora de caminata."

#: script/events/room.js:1261
msgid "she eats, and thanks the village, and has nothing to leave behind but the thanks."
msgstr "come, y agradece al poblado, y no tiene nada que dejar atrás salvo el agradecimiento."

#: script/outside.js:1068
msgid "she fails to hide her anger."
msgstr "no logra ocultar su enojo."

#: script/events/road.js:623
msgid "she gets the water down and then most of an hour later she can stand."
msgstr "logra beber el agua y luego, casi una hora después, puede ponerse de pie."

#: script/events/road.js:633
msgid "she gives up what is left in her pack, which is not much, and starts back the way she came."
msgstr "entrega lo que le queda en la mochila, que no es mucho, y emprende el regreso por donde vino."

#: script/builder.js:160
msgid "she goes very still when you describe him. says she knows exactly who that is, and what he signed, and that neither of those is the part that matters to her. says he was one of the two who stood up when the sentence was read. she does not say who the other one was."
msgstr "se queda muy quieta cuando lo describes. dice que sabe exactamente quién es, y qué firmó, y que ninguna de esas cosas es la parte que le importa. dice que él fue uno de los dos que se pusieron de pie cuando se leyó la sentencia. no dice quién fue el otro."

#: script/builder.js:218
msgid "she has been quieter since the huts went up, and it is a better quiet. says she has built for people who were being kept before. says this is not that."
msgstr "ha estado más callada desde que se levantaron las cabañas, y es un silencio mejor. dice que ha construido antes para gente que estaba siendo retenida. dice que esto no es eso."

#: script/events/road.js:628
msgid "she has been rationing to a schedule she wrote out beforehand. the schedule assumed the water would be where the map said."
msgstr "ha estado racionando según un horario que escribió de antemano. el horario asumía que el agua estaría donde decía el mapa."

#: script/events/road.js:625
msgid "she has been walking east for eleven days on four days of supplies, which she is aware does not work."
msgstr "ha estado caminando hacia el este durante once días con cuatro días de suministros, algo de lo que es consciente que no funciona."

#: script/events/road.js:626
msgid "she has been walking since a settlement that she names, and that nobody has heard of, and that she is certain is two days behind her."
msgstr "ha estado caminando desde un asentamiento que nombra, y del que nadie ha oído hablar, y del que está segura que queda a dos días detrás de ella."

#: script/events/room.js:1751
msgid "she has done something to her hand and has not mentioned it, and has been working one-handed for long enough that you only notice now."
msgstr "se ha hecho algo en la mano y no lo ha mencionado, y ha estado trabajando con una sola mano el tiempo suficiente para que recién ahora lo notes."

#: script/events/room.js:1755
msgid "she has hurt her hand and said nothing"
msgstr "se ha lastimado la mano y no ha dicho nada"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1724
msgid "she has more than she can use and no way to stop making it."
msgstr "tiene más de lo que puede usar y ninguna forma de dejar de producirlo."

#: script/space.js:769
msgid "she has never mentioned being able to do that.<br>you have never seen her do anything like it."
msgstr "nunca ha mencionado ser capaz de hacer eso.<br>nunca la has visto hacer algo parecido."

#: script/outside.js:1049
msgid "she hasn't completely escaped the dream. some of the terror remains in her face."
msgstr "no ha escapado por completo del sueño. algo del terror permanece en su rostro."

#: script/space.js:785
msgid "she holds it together long enough. the drives catch."
msgstr "se mantiene entera el tiempo suficiente. las unidades arrancan."

#: script/builder.js:146
msgid "she is careful with it in a way she is not careful with iron or coal. says she has seen what happens when this is stored wrong, and does not say where."
msgstr "es cuidadosa con eso de una forma en que no es cuidadosa con el hierro o el carbón. dice que ha visto lo que pasa cuando esto se almacena mal, y no dice dónde."

#: script/space.js:790
msgid "she is doing too much at once and you can see the moment it starts to come apart."
msgstr "está haciendo demasiado a la vez y puedes ver el momento en que empieza a desmoronarse."

#: script/builder.js:173
msgid "she is quiet for long enough that you think she is not going to say anything. then: that every name on a stone like that was a person who trusted somebody, once, right up until the point where trusting them was the mistake that killed them."
msgstr "se queda callada el tiempo suficiente para que pienses que no va a decir nada. luego: que cada nombre en una piedra así fue una persona que confió en alguien, alguna vez, justo hasta el punto en que confiar en ellos fue el error que los mató."

#: script/space.js:780
msgid "she is working eight stations at once and touching none of them.<br>readouts move. locks release. the drives come up."
msgstr "está trabajando ocho estaciones a la vez sin tocar ninguna.<br>las lecturas se mueven. los seguros se liberan. las unidades arrancan."

#: script/outside.js:1120
msgid "she isn't very talkative and that is fine by you."
msgstr "no es muy conversadora y eso te parece bien."

#: script/events/room.js:1245
msgid "she leaves three pages behind, torn out at the spine."
msgstr "deja tres páginas atrás, arrancadas del lomo."

#: script/events/room.js:1777
msgid "she lets you do it, which takes longer than the doing."
msgstr "te deja hacerlo, lo cual toma más tiempo que el hacerlo en sí."

#: script/builder.js:210
msgid "she listens to the whole of it without interrupting. says somebody built that, and lived in it, and is not there now. says this rock is mostly other people's endings."
msgstr "escucha todo sin interrumpir. dice que alguien construyó eso, y vivió en ello, y ya no está ahí. dice que esta roca es en su mayoría los finales de otras personas."

#: script/events/encounters.js:1702
msgid "she looks at you for a while longer than is comfortable."
msgstr "te mira durante un rato más largo de lo cómodo."

#: script/outside.js:1050
msgid "she looks away from you."
msgstr "aparta la mirada de ti."

#: script/easterEggs.js:73
msgid "she mentions, without looking up, that her name is Ayla. she does not bring it up again."
msgstr "menciona, sin levantar la vista, que su nombre es ayla. no lo vuelve a mencionar."

#: script/events/room.js:1188
msgid "she nods like she expected it, and does not write anything."
msgstr "asiente como si lo hubiera esperado, y no escribe nada."

#: script/room.js:2109
msgid "she nods, and does not say anything for a bit, and then says good."
msgstr "asiente, y no dice nada por un momento, y luego dice bien."

#: script/room.js:2094
msgid "she puts the plans down and does not pick them back up."
msgstr "deja los planos y no los vuelve a tomar."

#: script/events/road.js:629
msgid "she said kindness is rare here, but appreciated. she heard good things of you as of late."
msgstr "dijo que la bondad es escasa aquí, pero apreciada. ha oído cosas buenas de ti últimamente."

#: script/events/road.js:631
msgid "she said someone found her hidden water cache and raided it. there was no contigency plan beyond that."
msgstr "dijo que alguien encontró su reserva de agua oculta y la saqueó. no había plan de contingencia más allá de eso."

#: script/events/road.js:658
msgid "she says east was fine for nine days and then stopped being a direction."
msgstr "dice que el este estuvo bien durante nueve días y luego dejó de ser una dirección."

#: script/events/road.js:1571
msgid "she says if you knew what she knew, you would be kneeling and holding like her."
msgstr "dice que si supieras lo que ella sabe, estarías arrodillado y aferrándote como ella."

#: script/events/road.js:1572
msgid "she says if you wait long enough the Infinite Expanse cycle will restart."
msgstr "dice que si esperas lo suficiente el ciclo de la Extensión Infinita se reiniciará."

#: script/events/room.js:1805
msgid "she says it is fine and you agree that it is fine and the subject is closed."
msgstr "dice que está bien y tú aceptas que está bien y el tema queda cerrado."

#: script/events/room.js:1753
msgid "she says it is fine. it is visibly not fine."
msgstr "dice que está bien. visiblemente no lo está."

#: script/outside.js:1236
msgid "she says it is kind kind to ask, but some things are best left unsaid."
msgstr "dice que es amable preguntar, pero algunas cosas es mejor dejarlas sin decir."

#: script/events/road.js:1574
msgid "she says it is mostly silence where voices and signals once were."
msgstr "dice que es mayormente silencio donde antes había voces y señales."

#: script/events/road.js:657
msgid "she says nothing is east. says she checked."
msgstr "dice que no hay nada al este. dice que lo comprobó."

#: script/events/road.js:1568
msgid "she says she is holding. she says holding is the whole of it and there is nothing after holding."
msgstr "dice que está aguantando. dice que aguantar es todo y que no hay nada después de aguantar."

#: script/events/road.js:1567
msgid "she says she is waiting to be told she can stop. she says the order has not been given."
msgstr "dice que está esperando que le digan que puede detenerse. dice que la orden no se ha dado."

#: script/events/road.js:627
msgid "she says she stopped to think and could not work out how to start again. she says it took hours to notice."
msgstr "dice que se detuvo a pensar y no logró descifrar cómo volver a empezar. dice que tomó horas notarlo."

#: script/events/road.js:1570
msgid "she says she was told to wait here and that the person who told her was extremely clear about it."
msgstr "dice que le dijeron que esperara aquí y que la persona que se lo dijo fue extremadamente clara al respecto."

#: script/events/room.js:1218
msgid "she says the entry is not hers. it was already in the book when the book came to her."
msgstr "dice que la entrada no es suya. ya estaba en el libro cuando el libro llegó a ella."

#: script/events/road.js:1573
msgid "she says the Mysterious Wanderer can answer better than she can."
msgstr "dice que el errante misterioso puede responder mejor que ella."

#: script/events/encounters.js:1694
msgid "she says the village is just over there. she gestures at a direction with nothing in it."
msgstr "dice que el poblado está justo allá. hace un gesto hacia una dirección sin nada en ella."

#: script/events/outside.js:992
msgid "she says there are a great many of these. she says she has been walking past them her whole life."
msgstr "dice que hay muchísimas de estas. dice que ha estado pasando junto a ellas toda su vida."

#: script/events/road.js:659
msgid "she says there is nothing east, and then corrects herself, and says there is nothing east that stays where it is."
msgstr "dice que no hay nada al este, y luego se corrige, y dice que no hay nada al este que se quede donde está."

#: script/events/road.js:660
msgid "she says things that were east disappeared and other things that were east reappeared."
msgstr "dice que cosas que estaban al este desaparecieron y otras cosas que estaban al este reaparecieron."

#: script/events/room.js:1227
msgid "she says whoever wrote it had been here long enough to stop expecting to leave."
msgstr "dice que quien lo escribió había estado aquí lo suficiente como para dejar de esperar irse."

#: script/outside.js:1185
msgid "she seems confused when you ask as if you should know."
msgstr "parece confundida cuando preguntas, como si debieras saberlo."

#: script/outside.js:1011
#: script/outside.js:1067
msgid "she sees you there staring at her."
msgstr "te ve ahí mirándola fijamente."

#: script/outside.js:1222
msgid "she should be direct and speak up or not speak at all."
msgstr "debería ser directa y hablar claro o no hablar en absoluto."

#: script/outside.js:1065
msgid "she starts to speak. she is mumbling about a war. she screams that the exile doomed us all."
msgstr "empieza a hablar. murmura sobre una guerra. grita que el exiliado nos condenó a todos."

#: script/outside.js:1010
msgid "she starts to speak. she is mumbling about a war. she shrieks about human blood on her hands and finally bolts upright and awake."
msgstr "empieza a hablar. murmura sobre una guerra. chilla sobre sangre humana en sus manos y finalmente se incorpora de golpe, despierta."

#: script/events/road.js:685
msgid "she stopped walking a good while before she ran out of anything."
msgstr "dejó de caminar bastante antes de quedarse sin nada."

#: script/events/encounters.js:1723
msgid "she takes the fur without counting it and loads you up past what the fur was worth."
msgstr "toma la piel sin contarla y te carga con más de lo que la piel valía."

#: script/events/encounters.js:1726
msgid "she trades generously"
msgstr "comercia generosamente"

#: script/builder.js:138
msgid "she turns the ore over in both hands before she says anything. says whoever dug this vein meant it to still be findable. says that is a strange thing to plan for, and a stranger thing to be grateful for."
msgstr "da vueltas al mineral entre ambas manos antes de decir algo. dice que quien excavó esta veta quiso que aún pudiera encontrarse. dice que eso es algo extraño para planificar, y algo más extraño aún para agradecer."

#: script/events/room.js:1169
msgid "she turns the page. there are forty names on it, in nine hands, and none of them agree."
msgstr "da vuelta la página. hay cuarenta nombres en ella, de nueve letras distintas, y ninguna coincide."

#: script/events/outside.js:988
msgid "she turns the stone over looking for a mason's mark and finds one, scratched rather than cut."
msgstr "voltea la piedra buscando una marca de cantero y encuentra una, rasguñada en vez de tallada."

#: script/events/road.js:630
msgid "she was coming to terms with the end, and now has to process what comes next."
msgstr "estaba haciendo las paces con el final, y ahora tiene que procesar lo que viene después."

#: script/events/room.js:1167
msgid "she writes it down without looking up. asks how long that has been the name."
msgstr "lo anota sin levantar la vista. pregunta desde cuándo ese es el nombre."

#: script/events/encounters.js:97
msgid "shell splits"
msgstr "el caparazón se abre"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:469
msgid "shielded"
msgstr "blindado"

#: script/ship.js:51
msgid "Ship"
msgstr "Nave"

#: script/events/encounters.js:523
msgid "shivering human"
msgstr "humano tembloroso"

#: script/world.js:94
msgid "shoot"
msgstr "disparar"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1295
msgid "should be able to open it."
msgstr "debería poder abrirlo."

#: script/room.js:384
msgid "should cure the meat, or it'll spoil. builder says she can fix something up."
msgstr "la carne debe curarse, o se echará a perder. el constructor dice que puede hacer algo al respecto."

#: script/events/road.js:609
msgid "shout and keep going"
msgstr "gritar y seguir adelante"

#: script/events/executioner.js:515
msgid "shuffling noises can be heard from within."
msgstr "se oyen ruidos de arrastre desde el interior."

#: script/events/outside.js:219
msgid "Sickness"
msgstr "Enfermedad"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1228
msgid "siege automaton"
msgstr "autómata de asedio"

#: script/events/road.js:1514
msgid "sight along the way they face"
msgstr "alinear la mirada con hacia donde miran"

#: script/events/path.js:123
msgid "since after the meal, they say, and then cannot agree on which meal."
msgstr "desde después de la comida, dicen, y luego no logran ponerse de acuerdo sobre cuál comida."

#: script/events/road.js:1729
msgid "sit and watch it"
msgstr "sentarse y observarlo"

#: script/events/room.js:1643
msgid "sit with it"
msgstr "quedarse con ello"

#: script/outside.js:1064
msgid "siting in silence, ignoring the builder's suffering."
msgstr "sentado en silencio, ignorando el sufrimiento de la constructora."

#: script/outside.js:1009
msgid "sitting in silence, ignoring the builder`s suffering."
msgstr "sentado en silencio, ignorando el sufrimiento de la constructora."

#: script/events/road.js:115
msgid "sixty-one trips ended at this pile"
msgstr "sesenta y un viajes terminaron en este montón"

#: script/events/road.js:100
#: script/events/road.js:107
msgid "sixty-one."
msgstr "sesenta y uno."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:355
msgid "skitter"
msgstr "correteo"

#: script/world.js:76
msgid "slash"
msgstr "acuchillar"

#: script/outside.js:585
msgid "slave"
msgstr "esclavo"

#: script/outside.js:581
msgid "slaves"
msgstr "esclavos"

#: script/events/room.js:1655
msgid "sleep"
msgstr "dormir"

#: script/world.js:88
msgid "slice"
msgstr "tajo"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1536
msgid "slipped past an automated sentry."
msgstr "pasó desapercibido junto a un centinela automatizado."

#: script/events/executioner.js:2090
msgid "slipped through unnoticed."
msgstr "se coló sin ser visto."

#: script/dropbox.js:451
msgid "slot {0}: {1}"
msgstr "ranura {0}: {1}"

#: script/dropbox.js:452
msgid "slot {0}: empty"
msgstr "ranura {0}: vacía"

#: script/engine.js:37
msgid "slow metabolism"
msgstr "metabolismo lento"

#: script/graveyard.js:95
msgid "small coffins weigh the heaviest"
msgstr "los ataúdes pequeños pesan más"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1423
msgid "small sensors in the walls still look to be operational."
msgstr "pequeños sensores en las paredes aún parecen estar operativos."

#: script/events/executioner.js:2384
msgid "small weapons cache in a cabinet."
msgstr "pequeño alijo de armas en un gabinete."

#: script/events/room.js:1315
msgid "smash it"
msgstr "destrozarlo"

#: script/room.js:381
#: script/room.js:406
msgid "smokehouse"
msgstr "ahumadero"

#: script/room.js:1470
msgid "smoldering"
msgstr "latente"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4388
#: script/events/setpieces.js:5400
msgid "snarling"
msgstr "gruñendo"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1092
msgid "sniper"
msgstr "francotirador"

#: script/events/global.js:116
msgid "so are the shelves."
msgstr "también lo están los estantes."

#: script/events/outside.js:106
msgid "so dependent on fire for warmth and life until it takes it away."
msgstr "tan dependiente del fuego para el calor y la vida hasta que este se lo lleva."

#: script/space.js:801
msgid "so much debris of dead ships from long lost wars.<br>some wanderer ships. some others.<br>sky begins to clear into an endless expanse."
msgstr "tantos escombros de naves muertas de guerras hace mucho perdidas.<br>algunas naves errantes. otras no.<br>el cielo empieza a despejarse hacia una extensión infinita."

#: script/space.js:755
msgid "so much debris of dead ships from long lost wars.<br>the sky opens out, and there is nobody aboard but the two of you."
msgstr "tantos escombros de naves muertas de guerras hace mucho perdidas.<br>el cielo se abre, y no hay nadie a bordo salvo ustedes dos."

#: script/room.js:2072
msgid "so they have somewhere to be kept"
msgstr "para que tengan un lugar donde quedar retenidos"

#: script/room.js:2063
msgid "so they have somewhere to belong"
msgstr "para que tengan un lugar al cual pertenecer"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3261
msgid "so what happened to them"
msgstr "entonces qué les pasó"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1012
msgid "soldier"
msgstr "soldado"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:7076
msgid "soldiers patrol the perimeter, rifles slung over their shoulders."
msgstr "soldados patrullan el perímetro, fusiles al hombro."

#: script/events/outside.js:229
msgid "some {0} are ill"
msgstr "algunos {0} están enfermos"

#: script/events/outside.js:137
msgid "some {0} have died"
msgstr "algunos {0} han muerto"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2963
msgid "some are missing. others are closer than they ought to be."
msgstr "algunos faltan. otros están más cerca de lo que deberían."

#: script/events/executioner.js:2224
msgid "some completed explosives in the corner."
msgstr "algunos explosivos terminados en la esquina."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6248
msgid "some good stuff woven into its nest."
msgstr "algunas cosas buenas entretejidas en su nido."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4936
msgid "some medicine abandoned in the drawers."
msgstr "una medicina abandonada en los cajones."

#: script/events/road.js:452
msgid "some of the tracks shift from two feet to crawling and then being dragged away."
msgstr "algunas de las huellas cambian de dos pies a arrastrarse y luego a ser arrastrado."

#: script/events/outside.js:13
msgid "some of the traps have been torn apart."
msgstr "algunas de las trampas han sido destruidas."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1591
msgid "some of them are fixed and will not move. the rest turn under a fingertip."
msgstr "algunos están fijos y no se moverán. el resto gira bajo la yema de un dedo."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1885
msgid "some of them are human. some of them are wanderers. none of them appear to consider this worth remarking on."
msgstr "algunos de ellos son humanos. algunos de ellos son errantes. ninguno parece considerar que esto valga la pena mencionar."

#: script/events/outside.js:201
msgid "some of them are not anywhere."
msgstr "algunos de ellos no están en ninguna parte."

#: script/events/outside.js:200
msgid "some of them are still outside the wall in the morning."
msgstr "algunos de ellos siguen fuera del muro por la mañana."

#: script/events/road.js:1533
msgid "some of them have been kneeling long enough that the ground has come up around their knees."
msgstr "algunos de ellos han estado arrodillados el tiempo suficiente para que el suelo se haya elevado alrededor de sus rodillas."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3080
msgid "some of what it protected was worth protecting."
msgstr "algo de lo que protegía valía la pena proteger."

#: script/space.js:762
msgid "some part of you wonders whether you escaped at all,<br>or whether this is only the part where you get to leave."
msgstr "una parte de ti se pregunta si acaso escapaste,<br>o si esta es solo la parte donde te toca irte."

#: script/events/outside.js:22
msgid "some traps have been destroyed"
msgstr "algunas trampas han sido destruidas"

#: script/events/room.js:1029
msgid "some weird glowing boxes he picked up on his travels."
msgstr "unas cajas brillantes raras que recogió en sus viajes."

#: script/events/room.js:1013
msgid "some weird metal he picked up on his travels."
msgstr "un metal extraño que recogió en sus viajes."

#: script/events/room.js:262
#: script/events/room.js:282
#: script/events/room.js:302
msgid "some wood is missing."
msgstr "ha desaparecido algo de madera."

#: script/events/path.js:722
msgid "somebody built these huts out of a thing that came down here. a long time before anybody in this village did."
msgstr "alguien construyó estas cabañas a partir de algo que cayó aquí. mucho antes de que nadie en este poblado lo hiciera."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3079
msgid "somebody catalogued what they saw coming and then drew up what a settlement would need to survive it. both answers. they did not choose."
msgstr "alguien catalogó lo que veía venir y luego elaboró lo que un asentamiento necesitaría para sobrevivirlo. ambas respuestas. no eligieron."

#: script/events/road.js:918
msgid "somebody comes here. regularly. and then goes back the way they came."
msgstr "alguien viene aquí. con regularidad. y luego vuelve por donde vino."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3165
msgid "somebody dug here before. what is left of their kit is folded into the layer they stopped at."
msgstr "alguien excavó aquí antes. lo que queda de su equipo está incorporado en la capa donde se detuvieron."

#: script/events/road.js:320
msgid "somebody else has had this same idea, in this same spot, a great many times."
msgstr "alguien más ha tenido esta misma idea, en este mismo lugar, muchísimas veces."

#: script/events/road.js:152
msgid "somebody else's snares, with a catch in them"
msgstr "las trampas de otra persona, con algo atrapado"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3553
msgid "somebody has been at the last panel with a tool. the line about the people already living on those worlds is gouged out, and it was gouged out from the inside, by somebody who was locked in here."
msgstr "alguien ha estado en el último panel con una herramienta. la línea sobre la gente que ya vivía en esos mundos está arrancada, y fue arrancada desde adentro, por alguien encerrado aquí."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2655
msgid "somebody has been comparing something against something older, over and over, for a very long time, and writing down how far it has moved."
msgstr "alguien ha estado comparando algo contra algo más antiguo, una y otra vez, durante muchísimo tiempo, y anotando cuánto se ha movido."

#: script/events/room.js:1693
msgid "somebody has been counting the prints"
msgstr "alguien ha estado contando las huellas"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2995
msgid "somebody has been watching this sky, in shifts, across more successors than any one people could account for."
msgstr "alguien ha estado observando este cielo, por turnos, a través de más sucesores de los que un solo pueblo podría abarcar."

#: script/events/road.js:108
msgid "somebody has come out this far sixty-one times and put something on this pile, and gone back."
msgstr "alguien ha venido hasta aquí sesenta y una veces y ha puesto algo en este montón, y ha vuelto."

#: script/events/path.js:274
msgid "somebody has laid a line of stones along the edge of the path, running out towards the flats."
msgstr "alguien ha puesto una línea de piedras a lo largo del borde del camino, extendiéndose hacia las llanuras."

#: script/graveyard.js:69
msgid "somebody has scratched an addition under the carved text, much later and much worse."
msgstr "alguien ha rasguñado un añadido bajo el texto tallado, mucho después y mucho peor."

#: script/events/road.js:322
msgid "somebody has waited out this stretch before"
msgstr "alguien ha esperado antes a que pase este tramo"

#: script/village.js:77
msgid "somebody is at the door, out of breath, and does not knock first."
msgstr "alguien está en la puerta, sin aliento, y no toca antes."

#: script/events/road.js:595
msgid "somebody is sitting down out on the flats"
msgstr "alguien está sentado allá en las llanuras"

#: script/events/path.js:212
msgid "somebody presses a thumb into a handful of it and the print is still there in the morning, perfect."
msgstr "alguien presiona un pulgar en un puñado de eso y la huella sigue ahí por la mañana, perfecta."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3621
msgid "somebody says her name and she does not look up, and the name goes past you before you can hold on to it."
msgstr "alguien dice su nombre y ella no levanta la vista, y el nombre pasa junto a ti antes de que puedas retenerlo."

#: script/events/road.js:1209
msgid "somebody sealed this from the other side."
msgstr "alguien selló esto desde el otro lado."

#: script/events/room.js:1220
msgid "somebody translated it underneath, a long time after."
msgstr "alguien lo tradujo debajo, mucho tiempo después."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3571
msgid "somebody was held here through a trial"
msgstr "alguien fue retenido aquí durante un juicio"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3566
msgid "somebody was held here through a trial. the marks on the floor are a man walking the same four paces for a long time."
msgstr "alguien fue retenido aquí durante un juicio. las marcas en el suelo son de un hombre caminando los mismos cuatro pasos durante mucho tiempo."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3281
msgid "somebody was let out, a long way from here, and this is one of the places that cost."
msgstr "dejaron salir a alguien, muy lejos de aquí, y este es uno de los lugares que costó."

#: script/events/road.js:564
msgid "somebody with your hand has signed this stone five times. you are signing it for the first time."
msgstr "alguien con tu letra ha firmado esta piedra cinco veces. tú la firmas por primera vez."

#: script/prison.js:212
msgid "someone drew a symbol in this cell. it looks like your charms."
msgstr "alguien dibujó un símbolo en esta celda. se parece a tus amuletos."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6660
msgid "someone had been stockpiling loot here."
msgstr "alguien había estado acumulando un botín aquí."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5600
msgid "someone has locked and barricaded the door to this operating theatre."
msgstr "alguien ha bloqueado y hecho una barricada en la entrada de este teatro."

#: script/events/room.js:1298
msgid "someone in the village has got an old receiver working."
msgstr "alguien en el poblado ha logrado que un viejo receptor funcione."

#: script/events/room.js:187
msgid "someone left this. someone with less than this to spare."
msgstr "alguien dejó esto. alguien con menos que esto para dar."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5512
msgid "someone throws a stone."
msgstr "alguien lanza una piedra."

#: script/events/room.js:1406
msgid "something answered"
msgstr "algo respondió"

#: script/events/road.js:728
msgid "something came down here hard enough to leave a furrow half a mile long."
msgstr "algo cayó aquí con fuerza suficiente para dejar un surco de casi un kilómetro de largo."

#: script/village.js:149
msgid "something catches fire, and by the time it is noticed there is nothing left to save."
msgstr "algo se incendia, y para cuando se nota ya no queda nada que salvar."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2531
msgid "something crosses the corridor ahead, and it is made of light"
msgstr "algo cruza el corredor más adelante, y está hecho de luz"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:632
msgid "something detaches from the ceiling of the column room."
msgstr "algo se desprende del techo de la sala de columnas."

#: script/events/road.js:1122
msgid "something gives, high up, and the shaft goes past very fast."
msgstr "algo cede, en lo alto, y el pozo pasa muy rápido."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:193
msgid "something has gone up and down this a very great many times."
msgstr "algo ha subido y bajado por aquí muchísimas veces."

#: script/events/road.js:1377
msgid "something has settled out of the rain"
msgstr "algo se ha asentado de la lluvia"

#: script/lab.js:347
msgid "something in the back of your mind says to turn back now."
msgstr "algo en el fondo de tu mente dice que des la vuelta ahora."

#: script/events/room.js:1631
msgid "something is circling the room"
msgstr "algo está rondando la sala"

#: script/events/road.js:1283
msgid "something is exposed where the sand was stripped"
msgstr "algo queda expuesto donde se despojó la arena"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2190
msgid "something is moving out on the glass"
msgstr "algo se mueve allá sobre el vidrio"

#: script/events/room.js:1627
msgid "something is walking the perimeter of the room, slowly, and it has been for a while."
msgstr "algo camina el perímetro de la sala, despacio, y lo ha estado haciendo por un rato."

#: script/events/executioner.js:2263
msgid "something moving up ahead."
msgstr "algo se mueve más adelante."

#: script/events/room.js:1619
msgid "Something Outside"
msgstr "Algo Afuera"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:353
msgid "something small and very fast comes along the ceiling."
msgstr "algo pequeño y muy rápido se desplaza por el techo."

#: script/events/encounters.js:44
msgid "something small breaks cover, quills flared."
msgstr "algo pequeño sale de su escondite, las púas erizadas."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3649
msgid "something that was standing very still stops standing very still"
msgstr "algo que estaba muy quieto deja de estar muy quieto"

#: script/village.js:187
msgid "something the {0} call a feral terror is in among the huts before anyone sees it arrive."
msgstr "algo que los {0} llaman un terror salvaje está entre las cabañas antes de que nadie lo vea llegar."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1228
msgid "something the size of the corridor comes down the corridor."
msgstr "algo del tamaño del corredor baja por el corredor."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3032
msgid "something unfolds from the mounting and levels itself at you"
msgstr "algo se despliega desde el soporte y se dirige hacia ti"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:770
msgid "something very old finishes powering up."
msgstr "algo muy antiguo termina de encenderse."

#: script/events/encounters.js:1748
msgid "something wearing a wanderer"
msgstr "algo vistiendo a un errante"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1738
msgid "Something Wearing a Wanderer"
msgstr "Algo Vistiendo a un Errante"

#: script/space.js:685
msgid "something with three eyes and no mouth is watching, and for once it does not look away."
msgstr "algo con tres ojos y ninguna boca observa, y por una vez no aparta la mirada."

#: script/events/encounters.js:510
msgid "something with too many edges is already running at you."
msgstr "algo con demasiados bordes ya corre hacia ti."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4651
msgid "something's causing a commotion a ways down the road."
msgstr "algo está causando una conmoción en el camino."

#: script/events/room.js:226
